CHAPTER.VERS:
Send men for you, that they may spy out the land of Canaan, which I give to the sons of Israel: of every tribe of their fathers you

          {+}
         will send a man, every one a prince among them.

And Moses sent them to spy out the land of Canaan, and said to them, You

          {+}
         go up this way by the South, and go up into the hill-country:

and what the land is, whether it is fat or lean, whether there is wood in it, or not. And be

          {+}
         of good courage, and bring of the fruit of the land. Now the time was the time of the first-ripe grapes.
